  "body": "It would be very practical if `arrayBuffer()` method could take `begin` and `end` optional parameters in order to give the ability to reduce memory usage for cache responses whose content is \"huge\" but can still be useful in chunks (video and audio).\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nconst response = await caches.match('https://example.com/huge-file.mp4');\r\nconst slicedData = await response.arrayBuffer(0, 1024);\r\nreturn new Response(slicedData);\r\n```\r\n\r\nR: @jakearchibald\r\nFYI @paullewis",
